<title>USA: Sterling Financial files for offering.</title>
<headline>Sterling Financial files for offering.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling Financial Corp said it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed offering of $40 million of Cumulative Capital Securities by Sterling Capital Trust I, a Delaware business trust subsidiary of Sterling Financial Corporation.</p>
<p>The offering will be made through Dain Bosworth Incorporated and Piper Jaffray Inc.</p>
